   },
   "2:2": {
    "u": "https://phish.in/2026-04-23/fuego",
    "d": 2240,
    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Alt Lyric",
      "notes": "\"Viking warriors...girl begins to levitate\" lyrics were skipped, then Mike chants them during the jam"
     },
     {
      "name": "Alt Rig",
      "notes": "Fish on Marimba Lumina"
     },
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "Opening with snarling leads from Trey, this shifts at 9:40 into a more open terrain before Fishman takes command of the jam's direction. Wall of sound Mike and Page moves into a late-nite ambient space highlighted by Trey and Page trading delicate riffs around 13min. Moving deeper into the ether, the jam fades into sirens before a fake song interrupts a stunning Fuego."
     }
    ]
   },
   "2:4": {
    "u": "https://phish.in/2026-04-23/golden-age",
    "d": 712,
    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "Moving into a familiar hypnotic groove space we shift at 9:15 to a deeper groove which thus opens the space for the jam to blossom. Mike and Fish dominate here before Trey shifts the band into Fuego."
     }
    ]
   },
   "2:5": {
    "u": "https://phish.in/2026-04-23/fuego-2",
    "d": 303,
    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "Shifts quickly back into open-ended jamming following the repeated Fuego riff; Fish and Mike push them into a rock space before Trey returns with sky high riffs. Hard-rock fusion with Frankie Says esque riffing concludes before the jam fades out."
     }
    ]
   },
   "2:6": {
    "u": "https://phish.in/2026-04-23/backwards-down-the-number-line",
    "d": 515
   },
